WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.835 --> 00:00:13.135
Roxy pulled Terrell aside.

2
00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:18.337
"Someone robbed a doll show," she whispered.

3
00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:19.937
"I'll be back soon!"

4
00:00:19.957 --> 00:00:22.078
"Good luck," Terrell said.

5
00:00:22.098 --> 00:00:27.059
"I'll tell Jack and Mara you had to run home for a minute."

6
00:00:27.999 --> 00:00:30.000
Roxy arrived at Metro City Convention Center.

7
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.722
Detective Smith was talking to some people.

8
00:00:35.063 --> 00:00:36.124
He held a tiny coat.

9
00:00:36.905 --> 00:00:37.625
Roxy grinned.

10
00:00:37.645 --> 00:00:41.668
"That coat is too small for you, Detective."

11
00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:43.610
Detective Smith frowned.

12
00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:46.011
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl.

13
00:00:46.272 --> 00:00:48.173
This coat belongs to a doll."

14
00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:51.856
"A very special doll," a man said.

15
00:00:52.816 --> 00:00:54.097
He wore a bright green suit.

16
00:00:54.117 --> 00:00:56.199
"I spent a lot of money on it.

17
00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:57.360
It's from Europe."

18
00:00:58.276 --> 00:01:03.740
"My dolls are more than a hundred years old," a woman said, wiping a tear from her eye.

19
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.182
"And now they're gone!"

20
00:01:06.202 --> 00:01:09.064
"My dolls are gone too!"

21
00:01:09.604 --> 00:01:10.505
another person said.

22
00:01:11.205 --> 00:01:12.726
Detective Smith took out his notebook.

23
00:01:13.487 --> 00:01:15.168
"Did anyone see the thief?"

24
00:01:16.108 --> 00:01:17.529
The man in the green suit sniffed.

25
00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:21.272
"No. We were eating lunch in another room."

26
00:01:22.352 --> 00:01:23.073
The woman nodded.

27
00:01:23.093 --> 00:01:27.376
"I heard a loud crash, like glass being smashed.

28
00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.821
We ran in here, and She started to cry.

29
00:01:33.502 --> 00:01:34.802
The man patted her shoulder.

30
00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:36.583
"It's okay, Betty.

31
00:01:37.443 --> 00:01:38.983
Rocket Girl will save our dolls."

32
00:01:39.664 --> 00:01:40.504
He looked at Roxy.

33
00:01:41.004 --> 00:01:43.285
"Right?" "I'll do my best."

34
00:01:43.825 --> 00:01:46.466
Roxy couldn't believe how much these people liked their dolls!

35
00:01:46.486 --> 00:01:50.447
"I heard the thief," another woman said.

36
00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:54.328
"I was near the exit during the robbery.

37
00:01:55.096 --> 00:02:00.319
I heard someone say, 'I am bad, bad, bad!'"

38
00:02:01.159 --> 00:02:02.600
Detective Smith scratched his head.

39
00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.962
"I might know who the thief is.

40
00:02:05.882 --> 00:02:08.784
A performer named Chuck was at my nephew's birthday party.

41
00:02:09.404 --> 00:02:11.885
He had a large doll and was terrible.

42
00:02:12.486 --> 00:02:15.988
He said the same thing: 'I am bad, bad, bad.'"

43
00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:21.711
"If Chuck was terrible," Roxy said, "maybe he became a thief instead."

44
00:02:21.731 --> 00:02:23.652
"I have his business card."

45
00:02:24.288 --> 00:02:26.669
Detective Smith pulled the card from his pocket and looked at it.

46
00:02:26.689 --> 00:02:28.669
"He lives just around the corner.

47
00:02:28.909 --> 00:02:29.369
Let's go."

48
00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.871
Roxy and Detective Smith arrived at Chuck's apartment.

49
00:02:38.292 --> 00:02:39.732
The door was open, so they went in.

50
00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:42.453
"Chuck?" Detective Smith called.

51
00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:44.273
They heard a muffled voice.

52
00:02:47.214 --> 00:02:48.915
Roxy rushed to the closet and opened it.

53
00:02:49.515 --> 00:02:50.575
A man was tied up!

54
00:02:51.695 --> 00:02:53.236
Detective Smith quickly untied him.

55
00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.260
"Thank you!"

56
00:02:56.641 --> 00:02:57.161
Chuck said.

57
00:02:57.181 --> 00:02:58.502
"I'm so glad you're here.

58
00:02:58.762 --> 00:03:00.323
He's evil and out of control!"

59
00:03:00.343 --> 00:03:03.005
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

60
00:03:03.025 --> 00:03:06.368
"We're here because we thought you robbed the doll show."

61
00:03:07.549 --> 00:03:08.389
Chuck shook his head.

62
00:03:08.409 --> 00:03:09.710
"I wouldn't do that.

63
00:03:10.351 --> 00:03:10.911
It was him!"

64
00:03:10.931 --> 00:03:13.453
"Who?" Detective Smith asked.

65
00:03:13.473 --> 00:03:15.254
"Who do you think?"

66
00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:16.255
Chuck said.

67
00:03:16.275 --> 00:03:18.797
"My doll Chuckles!"
